{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-06/1063090/block/singleImage/3263585/df/14-3_5.jpg?updatedAt=1794319001\"/><figcaption>美國10月CPI按月升0.4%，高過預期。(資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>美國10月消費物價指數(CPI)按月上升0.4%，高過市場預期的0.3%，但較9月份的0.6%放緩。 10月核心CPI按月上升0.3%，同樣高於預期的0.2%，而且連續第三個月維持於0.3%。 由於去年10月美國政府停擺，沒有統計CPI數據，故此無法作出按年比較。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:55.964390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:56:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T02:44:20.234556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:21.119283+00:00","content_hash":"85b85f5d000561381d57f94de0d0f12b6a4e9b076110f5c9ff394542b27aec27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:55.964390+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}